# Guard for build-tarball's conditional patch application.
# Format: [!]<relpath-in-tarball>:<grep -E regex>   (ALL lines must hold)
# A leading '!' negates (the pattern must NOT be present).
#
# 0012 synthesises BLK_STS_P2PDMA for member completions on kernels whose
# block layer cannot produce it. It only makes sense on a tree that carries
# upstream's v6 completion handling, i.e. where raid1_write_error() exists.
# On the bare upstream `master` baseline that helper is absent and the whole
# patch would reject.
raid1-10.c:raid1_write_error
